# ML Training & Evaluation Datasets & Checkpoint Archive
#
# Datasets are large (~4.2GB) and regenerable - see archive/DATASET.md.
# The five ensemble checkpoints are NOT regenerable, so all five must stay
# tracked: model_service.py loads each one by name, and silently falls back
# to the EfficientNet baseline if any is missing.
